ontrolled trial. <source>Lancet</source> <volume>368</volume>:<fpage>1096</fpage>&#x02013;1105, <year>2006</year><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16997664</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="r8"><label>8</label><citation citation-type="journal">Bosch J, Yusuf S, Gerstein HC, Pogue J, Sheridan P, Dagenais G, Diaz R, Avezum A, Lanas F, Probstfield J, Fodor G, Holman RR: Effect of ramipril on the incidence of diabetes. <source>N Engl J Med</source> <volume>355</volume>:<fpage>1551</fpage>&#x02013;1562, <year>2006</year><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16980380</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="r9"><label>9</label><citation citation-type="journal">Williams D: Pregnancy: a stress test for life. <source>Curr Opin Obstet Gynecol.</source> <volume>15</volume>:<fpage>465</fpage>&#x02013;471, <year>2003</year><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14624211</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="r10"><label>10</label><citation citation-type="journal">Sibai BM, el-Nazer A, Gonzalez-Ruiz A: Severe preeclampsia-eclampsia in young primigravid women: subsequent pregnancy outcome and remote prognosis. <source>Am J Obstet Gynecol</source> <volume>155</volume>:<fpage>1011</fpage>&#x02013;1016, <year>1986</year><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3777042</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="r11"><label>11</label><citation citation-type="journal">Pallardo LF, Herranz L, Martin-Vaquero P, Garcia-Ingelmo T, Grande C, Janez M: Impaired fasting glucose and impaired glucose tolerance in women with prior gestational diabetes are associated with a different cardiovascular profile. <source>Diabetes Care</source> <volume>26</volume>:<fpage>2318</fpage>&#x02013;2322, <year>2003</year><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12882855</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="r12"><label>12</label><citation citation-type="journal">Lauenborg J, Hansen T, Jensen DM, Vestergaard H, Molsted-Pedersen L, Hornnes P, Locht H, Pedersen O, Damm P: Increasing incidence of diabetes after gestational diabetes: a long-term follow-up in a Danish population. <source>Diabetes Ca